        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<h2>PTO Request Submitted</h2>\n<p>Your time off request has been submitted and is pending approval.</p>\n\n<div style=\"background: #e3f2fd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n<p><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{ $json.request_id }}</p>\n<p><strong>Leave Type:</strong> {{ $json.leave_type }}</p>\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> {{ $json.start_date }} to {{ $json.end_date }}</p>\n<p><strong>Days Requested:</strong> {{ $json.days_requested }}</p>\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> Pending Approval</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>You will be notified once your manager reviews your request.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"{{ $env.PTO_PORTAL_URL }}/my-requests/{{ $json.request_id }}\">View Request Status</a></p>\n</div>",
